    "text": "WLFI.com\nwebsite\nLafayette\nNew playground and shelter coming to Lafayette's Woodfield Village\nBy Chris Essex,\n8 hours agoLAFAYETTE, Ind. (WLFI) — Lafayette Parks and Recreation has announced a new maintenance agreement with the Woodfield Village Homeowners Association, bringing significant improvements to the neighborhood park. The agreement, which began in the spring of 2024, is set for 20 years. It features a new playground and picnic shelter...\n2",
